{"id": null, "n": "0676004", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0676004", "type": "mod", "text": "唯【大】＊，惟【宋】【元】【明】【甲】＊"}
{"id": null, "n": "0676005", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0676005", "type": "mod", "text": "已【大】，已佛【考偽-甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0676006", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0676006", "type": "mod", "text": "為【CB】【思溪乙-CB】【普寧-CB】【嘉興乙-CB】【宋】【元】【明】【甲】，謂【大】"}
